            <title>[IGNITE-7947] Not all OWNING partitions saved in PartitionAllocationMap during checkpoint</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7947</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In checkpoint begin listeners we collect PartitionAllocationMap in offheap managers. &lt;br/&gt;
